			"notes": "- Android launchers (PojavLauncher and its forks, such as Amethyst) get the GLFW backend: SDL2 loads a glibc native\n  there that crashes at random\n- The gamepad works as on a console: the D-pad moves the focus between widgets, A confirms, B goes back on every screen\n  (the inventory included), Y is quick move, and on screens the triggers are the mouse buttons\n- D-pad navigation reaches the small buttons under a wide one, the focus stays visible on checkboxes, and the radial\n  menu no longer starts empty\n- Own jar name (dras-gamepad, so Amethyst does not delete it), version and issue tracker"
